    ^{:line 47 :tag (slice Edge) :doc "Inverse of successors.\nThe order is significant to Phi nodes in the block.\nTODO: predecessors is a pain to maintain. Can we somehow order phi\narguments by block id and have this field computed explicitly when needed?\n"} Preds










