^{:go/end 236} (go/method Reset "Reset sets the block to the provided kind and clears all the blocks control\nand auxiliary values. Other properties of the block, such as its successors,\npredecessors and values are left unmodified.\n" [^{:tag (* Block)} b ^BlockKind kind]
  (set! (.-Kind b) kind)
